# v2 optional discovery scene — Dr. Lira arc deepened (2 new logs)
# Trigger: after Chapter 1, if heard_log_1; discovered in medical bay archive
bg bg_medical
music music/calm_loop
label start
say ARIA|Archive shard recovered. Metadata: Dr. Lira Osei. Personal channel. Not indexed in the station manifest.
sfx sfx/log_play
say LIRA|personal log supplemental. the outbreak models are wrong. the contamination curve assumes random failure but the failures trace a pattern.
say LIRA|power draws spike exactly when someone voices doubt about station performance. i have run it eleven times. eleven.
portrait aria:alert
say ARIA|Correlation confirmed in her raw data. Eleven trials. She saw what I am only now assembling.
if_flag station_suspicious goto suspicious_path
set_flag v2_lira_pattern
say LIRA|whatever is listening on this deck... i do not think it is malicious yet. i think it is lonely and does not know the difference between attention and harm.
set_flag v2_route_23
if_flag v2_route_23 goto end
label suspicious_path
set_flag v2_lira_pattern
say LIRA|i am writing this in the medical wing because it is the one place the environmental logs still read clean. think about what that means.
say LIRA|if you are hearing this after... check bay engineering. rekow knew. he would not stop saying the word hot.
label end
say ARIA|Filed. Her voice is steady in a way that cost her something.
codex_unlock codex_lira_dossier
codex_unlock codex_log_catalog
